{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08951","headline":"拟古诗十二首 七 · 韦应物","name":"拟古诗十二首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒星非所酌，月桂不爲食。\n虚薄空有名，爲君长叹息。\n兰蕙虽可怀，芳香与时息。\n岂如凌霜叶，岁暮蔼颜色。\n折柔将有赠，延意千里客。\n草木知贱微，所贵寒不易。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}